<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST, FIRST DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE FIRST TEST, FIRST DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
